31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first night has passed, the Seer should have some information. Does anyone want to come forward, or should we look for clues in how people are acting this morning?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! I'm awake! Did the Seer find something super juicy? Come on, tell us! I bet someone's acting all nervous right now!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I divined Kenji last night, and the result was that he is the werewolf. We should consider executing him today.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very direct and bold claim to make so early. Toshio, are you certain you are the Seer, or could this be a strategic move to eliminate a player quickly?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way! Toshio, why are you lying? I'm not the werewolf! I'm just a regular guy! You can't just point at me and say I'm the bad guy!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, claiming the Seer role and identifying the werewolf on day one is a high-risk move. If you're lying, you've just exposed yourself. Kenji, your reaction is quite emotional; is that genuine shock or a performance?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, this is getting intense! It's like a movie! Kenji looks so surprised, but Toshio sounds so sure. Who should we believe? This is the scariest part of the game!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"My certainty comes from the divination result, not a guess. If I were the werewolf or possessed, claiming the Seer role this early and targeting a specific player would be an unnecessary risk that invites immediate scrutiny.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"While the risk is high, a werewolf might claim the Seer role to eliminate a villager and gain trust. However, Toshio's composure is consistent. Kenji, your desperation is noted, but emotion is not proof of innocence.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not performing! I'm actually scared because you're just deciding I'm the wolf without any proof other than your word! Please, everyone, don't listen to him! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If Toshio is the Seer, the game ends today if we vote for Kenji. If Toshio is the werewolf, he's trying to win immediately. We have to decide if Toshio's logic is more reliable than Kenji's plea.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like seeing Kenji so sad! But Toshio is usually so calm and serious, he wouldn't just make something up for a prank, right? This is so hard! I can't decide!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The most logical course of action is to trust the divination. If I am lying, I will be the primary suspect tomorrow. But if I am the Seer, letting the werewolf live another night only risks more innocent lives.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Toshio's point about the risk is compelling. If he is the werewolf, he has placed a target on his own back for tomorrow. I am inclined to trust the Seer's revelation in this instance.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Please, don't do this! Jonathan, you're usually so fair! If you all vote for me, the real wolf is still out there and will just kill someone else tonight! I'm telling the truth!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The evidence is purely based on trust, but Toshio's consistency and the risk he's taking make his claim plausible. I believe we should follow the Seer's lead and vote for Kenji.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I don't want to be mean to Kenji, but Toshio seems really sure! If we don't do it now, the wolf might eat us all! I'll vote for Kenji!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The decision is clear. To ensure the safety of the village, we must act on the information provided. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have weighed the arguments, and the logic of the risk Toshio is taking outweighs Kenji's emotional appeal. I will vote for Kenji.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"This is so unfair! You're all just going to believe him over me? I'm not the wolf! Please, just give me one more day to prove it! I'll vote for Kenji, but I'm telling you, you're making a huge mistake!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
